# KiCad lock files, written while a file is open in KiCad
~*.lck
# KiCad's automatic project backups and autosaves
*-backups/
_autosave-*
\#auto_saved_files\#
*.bak
*-bak
fp-info-cache
# KiCad's per-user view settings (open panels, column widths), rewritten on every save
*.kicad_prl
# Routing-only footprint variants, swapped in for the Specctra export and back out
# again afterwards (see README, "Notes on the tool")
solartron.pretty/*Route.kicad_mod
